WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Follow one car through one corner.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The outside tire follows the longer curve.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Locked drive wheels would scrub through the turn.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Small bevel gears let the two axle speeds differ.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
42 and 18 average to 30 rpm at the carrier.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Shared drive, different wheel speeds. Source: MIT 2.972.
